          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best garage floor mat is the one that matches what lands on your floor. For winter slush, that means a containment mat with a raised edge, and the AutoFloorGuard AFG7918 is the one to buy for most cars. For oil, it means an absorbent drip pad with a waterproof backing under the engine.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
